msgctxt "66\t244"
msgid "Many people stood in our way as we\\ncontinued our investigation."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280\t425"
msgid ""
"Futo Shimano, who was after both the 10\\nbillion and the position of "
"chairman..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "455\t555"
msgid "We meet at last, Kiryu!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568\t727"
msgid "Goro Majima, lieutenant of\\nthe Shimano Family..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "750\t860"
msgid "Hey, Kazzy. I've been lookin' for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892\t1065"
msgid ""
"Our fight against the hard<Sign:22>bitten veterans\\nof many yakuza wars was"
" as fierce as ever."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1063\t1285"
msgid ""
"Lastly, there was Yayoi, wife of Sohei\\nDojima, the man who was murdered in"
" 1995."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1286\t1360"
msgid "Are you the one who killed my husband?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1373\t1500"
msgid "Her words hung heavy on my heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1529\t1660"
msgid "And yet there were also people who\\ntried to help me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692\t1843"
msgid ""
"Kazuki, the owner of the host bar,\\nStardust, and one of the hosts, Yuya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1854\t1916"
msgid "Terada from the Omi Alliance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1940\t2084"
msgid "These people, whom I met through\\nmy father, gave me courage to go on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2092\t2119"
msgid "And finally..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2140\t2299"
msgid "I met a man who helped me get to the\\nbottom of what had happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2310\t2450"
msgid "Kazuma Kiryu. You didn't waste any time\\nmaking a name for yourself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2490\t2552"
msgid "His name was Kage."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2589\t2692"
msgid ""
"He was a legendary information dealer\\nwho worked in Kamurocho's "
"underground."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2718\t2810"
msgid "I've got video of that bar, Serena."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2826\t3012"
msgid ""
"Kage's information led us to the man who\\nhad been controlling everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3030\t3178"
msgid "Kage thought he might be a member of a\\nsecret government organization."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3179\t3393"
msgid ""
"When I looked into it, I discovered an\\nunderground government agency "
"called MIA."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3394\t3590"
msgid "A politician had been involved with the\\nstolen 10 billion yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3606\t3666"
msgid "His name was Jingu Kyohei."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3676\t3811"
msgid ""
"He had given the money to the Tojo Clan\\nas part of an investment scheme."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3829\t3939"
msgid "Jingu had been using the Tojo Clan to\\nmake money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3962\t4156"
msgid ""
"The people who had stolen the money had\\ndone so to protect the Tojo Clan "
"from Jingu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4169\t4215"
msgid "But who were they?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4230\t4433"
msgid "Kazuma... We stole the money.\\nMe, Yumi, and Sera..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4469\t4558"
msgid "At last, I had discovered the truth."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4572\t4594"
msgid "However..."
msgstr "Però..."

msgctxt "4649\t4680"
msgid "Yaaaa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4700\t4760"
msgid "Haruka! Pop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4769\t4878"
msgid "After sacrificing his life to save Haruka..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4960\t5034"
msgid "...my father told me everything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5178\t5535"
msgid "Forgive me, Kazuma.\\nI'm the one... who killed your parents."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5610\t5690"
msgid "It's all right. It's all right, Pop!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "5755\t6120"
msgid "You'll... You'll always be my father!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6159\t6298"
msgid "After revealing the secret that he had\\nkept for so long..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "6308\t6420"
msgid "...my father passed away."
msgstr ""
